<SECTION SCID = "T010254A135S"><script xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" src="/_runtime/xslt-polyfill.min.js"></script><SCTITLE/>

<PARA INFOID = "T010254A135" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "15Dec2003"     INFOTYPE = "PARTS" INDSW = "ON">
<TITLE>Accessory Layout</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>A serpentine belt drive system, in which all accessories are driven by 1 belt, has been adopted, shortening the overall engine length, reducing weight and improving serviceability.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>An automatic tensioner for the V-ribbed belt has been adopted, extending the life of the belt and accessories, making them maintenance-free and improving serviceability when removing and installing the belt. The tension of the V-ribbed belt is kept at the appropriate value by the coil spring built into the automatic tensioner.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>A torsional damper pulley has been adopted for the crankshaft pulley to reduce torsional vibration of the crankshaft.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<FIGURE>
<GRAPHIC GRAPHICNAME = "a4740175p" WIDTH = "6.903in" HEIGHT = "3.500in" />
</FIGURE>
